  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme d&#x2019;Appui pour la Consolidation de la Stabilit&#xe9; en RDC (PACS-RDC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme will support our objective to build peace in eastern DRC. It will focus on the three provinces in eastern DRC (Ituri, North and South Kivus) worst affected by violent conflict leveraging our comparative advantage by deploying HMG expertise from Kinshasa, Goma, London and New York to influence the DRC government, MONUSCO and other donors. The Concept Note includes a multi-donor stabilisation programming alongside targeted UK bilateral support on DDR, conflict prevention and conflict sensitivity.</narrative>
  </description>
